Here's a simple function in JavaScript that sorts an object by its keys:

```javascript
function sortByKeys(obj) {
  const sortedKeys = Object.keys(obj).sort();
  const sortedObj = {};

  sortedKeys.forEach(key => {
    sortedObj[key] = obj[key];
  });

  return sortedObj;
}
```

