\section{Issue Description}
We are experiencing technical issues with the integration of a third-party API within our multi-tiered system architecture. The API is not properly communicating with our backend servers, resulting in errors and inconsistencies in data retrieval.

\subsection{Error Messages and Codes}
The following error messages and codes have been encountered:

\begin{itemize}
    \item Error Code: 401 Unauthorized
    \item Error Message: "Unauthorized. Please check your API credentials."
    \item Error Code: 403 Forbidden
