\section{Proposed Solution/Workaround}
To resolve this issue, we propose the following solutions:

\begin{itemize}
    \item Verify API credentials and ensure they are correct.
    \item Check firewall settings to ensure the API is allowed to communicate with our backend servers.
    \item Implement a caching mechanism to reduce the number of requests to the API.
