To pass credentials in the JavaScript code of `react-native-fbsdk-next`, you can use the `FBSDK.setCredentials()` method. This method takes an object as an argument, where you can specify the access token and other credentials. Here's an example:
```javascript
FBSDK.setCredentials({
  accessToken: 'your_access_token',
  expiresIn: 'your_expires_in',
});
