Make sure to replace `'your_access_token'` with your actual access token and `'your_expires_in'` with the expiration time of the token. You can also pass other credentials like the user ID, email, and name.

Here's an example of how to use the `FBSDK.setCredentials()` method in conjunction with the `FBSDK.login()` method:
```javascript
FBSDK.login(function(error, result) {
  if (error) {
    console.log('Error logging in: ', error);
  } else {
    FBSDK.setCredentials({
      accessToken: result.authResponse.accessToken,
      expiresIn: result.authResponse.expiresIn,
    });
    console.log('Logged in successfully!');
